# B1 and B5 pinned to MR32_NR7, mirroring bert_b1_b5.dat's shapes exactly, so 32x6 and 32x7
# are compared on identical (M, N, K) inputs. Used by config_b1b5_nr7_first.json and
# config_b1b5_nr6_first.json (the #37 test, extended to the two BERT layers #37 left out).
# layer  M      N    K
